# AI Prompts (super-admin editable system + user-turn templates)

Editable storage for the prompts powering every AI feature: proofreading, MD generation, **auto question tagging**, the dashboard **Explain** tutor, the figure-bbox detector, and PDF Batch Import (box detection, anchor/segment detection, and paper-name guess). Twenty prompts total, in eight groups. Super-admin only — prompts shape global model behaviour, so the bar is the same as System Settings.

## Files map

| Concern | File(s) |
|---|---|
| Registry + resolver + cache + parsers | [app/ai_prompts.py](mdc:app/ai_prompts.py) `PROMPTS_REGISTRY`, `get_prompt`, `render_prompt`, `set_prompt`, `reset_prompt`, `invalidate_cache`, `as_dict` |
| DB override storage | [app/models.py](mdc:app/models.py) `PromptOverride` (table `prompt_overrides`) |
| Routes (super-admin) | [app/admin.py](mdc:app/admin.py) `prompts_page`, `prompts_data`, `prompts_save`, `prompts_reset` |
| Admin UI | [templates/admin_prompts.html](mdc:templates/admin_prompts.html) |
| Auto-create table | [app/__init__.py](mdc:app/__init__.py) (alongside `system_settings`) |

