9. `FIGURE_BOX_JSON_CONTRACT` (system, sub-template) — figure bbox 0–1000 contract
10. `FIGURE_BOX_SYSTEM` (system, var `json_contract`) — figure bbox detection during MD gen
11. `FIGURE_BOX_USER` (user)
12. `PDF_BOX_JSON_CONTRACT` (system, sub-template) — shared JSON contract
13. `PDF_QUE_BOX_SYSTEM` (system, var `json_contract`)
14. `PDF_SOL_BOX_SYSTEM` (system, var `json_contract`)
15. `PDF_BOX_USER` (user, var `what`)
16. `PDF_ANCHOR_JSON_CONTRACT` (system, sub-template) — segment-method shared contract
17. `PDF_ANCHOR_SYSTEM` (system, vars `what`, `json_contract`)
18. `PDF_ANCHOR_USER` (user, var `what`)
